WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:16.253
Cat ducked into Tom's pocket.

2
00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:27.401
The dog shot back in the air.

3
00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:35.441
"Oh no." Tom read the dog spell again.

4
00:00:35.442 --> 00:00:40.932
"This dog will disappear in a few minutes!"

5
00:00:40.933 --> 00:00:47.984
Cat looked around the lab.

6
00:00:47.985 --> 00:01:00.701
"I have an idea."

7
00:01:00.702 --> 00:01:05.865
Soon Tom hurried into the Royal Ballroom.

8
00:01:05.866 --> 00:01:10.176
It was full of guests and gifts.

9
00:01:10.177 --> 00:01:16.134
The queen clapped her hands.

10
00:01:16.135 --> 00:01:22.624
"It's time for the prince's gift!"

11
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:26.262
Tom opened a door.

12
00:01:26.263 --> 00:01:34.267
Everyone gasped as the dog flew inside.

13
00:01:34.268 --> 00:01:36.917
"Wow!" Prince Eric cried.

14
00:01:36.918 --> 00:01:40.413
"I got a flying dog!"

15
00:01:40.414 --> 00:01:44.817
"I want one too!" yelled a princess.

16
00:01:44.818 --> 00:01:56.119
The dog flew around the room.

17
00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:02.184
But soon Prince Eric was bored.

18
00:02:02.185 --> 00:02:11.831
"Mommy, I want to pet that doggie!"

19
00:02:11.832 --> 00:02:16.804
Everyone looked at Tom.

20
00:02:16.805 --> 00:02:24.335
Cat was ready.

21
00:02:24.336 --> 00:02:29.047
She jumped out of Tom's pocket.

22
00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:33.176
The dog saw Cat and flew down.

23
00:02:33.177 --> 00:02:40.234
Poof! The dog disappeared!

24
00:02:40.235 --> 00:02:45.588
Tom reached into his pocket.

25
00:02:45.589 --> 00:02:54.131
"What's going on, Wizard?" Dirk snapped.

26
00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:56.364
The queen was frowning.

27
00:02:56.365 --> 00:03:00.555
"Tom," she said. "Where is—"

28
00:03:00.556 --> 00:03:07.470
"Here!" Tom held out his hand.

29
00:03:07.471 --> 00:03:13.000
Prince Eric blinked in surprise.

30
00:03:13.001 --> 00:03:17.379
"You turned the dog into a frog!" he said.

31
00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.124
Tom nodded.

32
00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:24.375
"I like frogs better than dogs!" the prince cried.

33
00:03:24.376 --> 00:03:27.013
Dirk scowled.

34
00:03:27.014 --> 00:03:30.205
Tom gave the gift to the prince.

35
00:03:30.206 --> 00:03:43.443
"Happy Birthday, Prince Eric!" he said.
